WEBVTT

00:11.330 --> 00:12.750
It's over, Max!

00:13.460 --> 00:15.630
Infinity Oblivion Nebula!

00:15.630 --> 00:18.000
Wheel of Chaos Theory!

00:18.580 --> 00:20.830
That ball is now a swirling, galactic vortex!

00:20.830 --> 00:23.250
Once released from the bonds
of its mathematical trajectory,

00:23.250 --> 00:25.630
it shall become a comet
and fly straight past you!

00:25.630 --> 00:27.250
To the right?!

00:28.170 --> 00:30.250
Too bad! Wrong choice, Max!

00:30.460 --> 00:31.460
Victory is mine!

00:31.460 --> 00:35.460
You were destined to buy me that
iced coffee from the very beginning!

00:37.000 --> 00:38.670
Wh-what?! He managed to hit it?!

00:38.670 --> 00:42.250
And he utilized the momentum of
the nebula's rotation!

00:42.540 --> 00:43.630
It matters not!

00:43.630 --> 00:48.290
This is child's play for one such as I!

00:51.790 --> 00:54.290
Uh-oh... We broke another one.

00:54.290 --> 00:56.710
Just ain't sturdy enough, are they?

02:27.460 --> 02:33.460
<b>#6 Border Tug-of-War</b>

02:35.170 --> 02:37.000
Worked up a nice sweat, didn't we?

02:37.670 --> 02:38.670
Yup.

02:41.330 --> 02:43.670
Gosh, this water feels fantastic.

02:43.670 --> 02:46.630
I'm used to that tiny bathroom of ours.

02:46.630 --> 02:48.290
I can actually stretch my legs out...

02:48.290 --> 02:49.540
Aren't you glad we came here?

02:49.960 --> 02:51.710
I guess so...

02:53.580 --> 02:55.290
Max, are you out there?

02:55.290 --> 02:57.540
Huh? Yeah, I'm right here.

02:57.540 --> 02:59.500
Can you hand me one of the big towels?

02:59.500 --> 03:01.540
I forgot to grab one.

03:01.540 --> 03:02.580
Sure.

03:04.630 --> 03:06.290
I'm leavin' it outside the door.

03:06.290 --> 03:08.460
Oh, uh, can you bring it to me instead?

03:08.460 --> 03:10.130
Do I have to...?

03:10.130 --> 03:12.830
I'm going to get the floor wet
if I walk all the way over there.

03:14.920 --> 03:17.630
Fine, whatever. I'm comin' in.

03:17.630 --> 03:18.460
'Kay.

03:19.790 --> 03:21.580
Thanks a bunch, Max.

03:23.500 --> 03:24.420
Sure...

03:29.460 --> 03:31.500
C'mon, open wide!

03:32.500 --> 03:33.710
Knock it off.

04:01.040 --> 04:03.210
<b>Souvenirs</b>

04:01.040 --> 04:03.210
<b>A Gamma Republic Exclusive!!</b>

04:01.040 --> 04:03.210
<b>Insta-worthy    Snow Globes!</b>

04:04.040 --> 04:05.750
Nah, I'll pass.

04:08.210 --> 04:10.330
Oh man, I had a blast!

04:10.330 --> 04:12.380
Remind me why we came here again...?

04:12.380 --> 04:15.170
Uh, attention all pedestrians!

04:16.170 --> 04:19.460
This is an announcement from
the Republic Patrol!

04:19.460 --> 04:22.880
As of now, we are restricting access
to the area surrounding

04:22.880 --> 04:25.420
the Beskar Kingdom-Gamma Republic border!

04:25.920 --> 04:27.880
Isn't she the woman from before...?

04:27.880 --> 04:32.670
We apologize for the inconvenience,
but your cooperation is appreciated!

04:32.670 --> 04:36.210
Please note that all public transit
outside the restricted zone,

04:36.210 --> 04:40.460
including airship and water transport,
are operating as normal!

04:41.080 --> 04:43.790
This is an announcement from
the Republic Patrol!

04:45.500 --> 04:47.460
Looks like she didn't spot us.

04:47.460 --> 04:48.920
Of course she didn't...

04:48.920 --> 04:50.500
The area near the border?

04:50.500 --> 04:52.710
That must mean they're fighting
with the Kingdom...

04:52.710 --> 04:55.630
I hope everything's alright...
It makes me nervous.

04:56.000 --> 04:57.880
Do you think there's about to be a battle?

04:57.880 --> 04:59.380
This could get ugly.

04:59.380 --> 05:01.080
We oughtta skedaddle while we can.

05:03.080 --> 05:03.960
You again?!

05:03.960 --> 05:06.500
Oh please, there's no need to worry!

05:06.500 --> 05:08.210
This happens all the time.

05:08.210 --> 05:11.830
They're always gettin' into little spats
with each other at the border!

05:11.830 --> 05:13.500
Here, have a sample or two!

05:13.130 --> 05:17.960
<b>Hot Spring Specialties</b>

05:13.500 --> 05:18.460
Look around. All us locals and gift shop
employees are cool as cucumbers!

05:18.460 --> 05:19.960
We're used to it by now.

05:20.580 --> 05:21.880
She's got a point...

05:21.880 --> 05:25.080
Ain't that what they call "normalcy bias"...?

05:25.460 --> 05:26.500
Eat up! Take as many as you like!

05:26.500 --> 05:28.330
We could use this to our advantage...
Eat up! Take as many as you like!<b></b>

05:28.330 --> 05:29.170
Huh?
Eat up! Take as many as you like!<b></b>

05:29.170 --> 05:31.830
Alright, let's head for the border, Max!

05:33.380 --> 05:35.080
The hell are you talkin' about?!

05:35.080 --> 05:36.880
This is the perfect opportunity to see

05:36.880 --> 05:40.630
both the Kingdom's and the Republic's
military capabilities with our own eyes!

05:40.630 --> 05:42.170
Besides, now that I think about it,

05:42.170 --> 05:44.830
we haven't done any sort of
reconnaissance thus far!

05:44.830 --> 05:46.880
Are you kidding me?! Go by yourself!

05:46.880 --> 05:48.040
I'm going home!

05:48.540 --> 05:52.460
<b>Trachigo</b>

05:49.330 --> 05:52.460
But I'M the one who has our return tickets.

05:52.630 --> 05:55.830
And I'M the only one who can use
my teleportal to teleport back home.

05:55.830 --> 05:57.420
Give it up.

05:57.420 --> 05:59.170
You bastard...

05:59.920 --> 06:03.290
Okay, but how do you plan on
gettin' to the border?

06:03.290 --> 06:06.000
Don't tell me yer gonna try and
walk through the restricted zone...

06:07.290 --> 06:09.250
Just leave that part to me.

06:09.960 --> 06:12.880
<b>Lil Hot Spring</b>

06:10.460 --> 06:11.710
Say cheese!

06:16.040 --> 06:18.670
I've got EXTRA pep in my step today!

06:18.670 --> 06:20.380
Must be that dip I took in the hot spring...

06:20.380 --> 06:24.710
At this rate, we'll make it to
the border in no time!

06:29.040 --> 06:30.250
Too heavy...

06:38.040 --> 06:39.830
Ugh, I'm exhausted!

06:39.830 --> 06:42.330
You're not exactly the lightest passenger...

06:42.330 --> 06:44.170
All you ever do is pig out and pass out...

06:44.750 --> 06:47.000
Just look at how pudgy you are!

06:47.000 --> 06:49.290
'Cause I been eatin' good lately...

06:50.540 --> 06:51.830
Just joking...

06:54.750 --> 06:57.420
That shoddy stone wall must be the border.

06:58.750 --> 07:01.500
Might as well sit back and
enjoy the show, Max!

07:01.880 --> 07:02.960
Let's see...

07:06.920 --> 07:08.290
FIRE!

07:09.830 --> 07:11.710
Same strategy as always...

07:11.710 --> 07:15.500
Yeah. That's why I sent the boss out fishin'.

07:16.500 --> 07:19.630
Getting him needlessly involved
is more dangerous for everyone.

07:19.630 --> 07:21.000
Return fire!

07:21.000 --> 07:22.080
Eat this!

07:28.130 --> 07:29.670
C-c'mon! Hang in there!

07:33.880 --> 07:35.580
What sort of toys are those?

07:35.580 --> 07:38.290
Tactical weapons that shoot magic.

07:38.290 --> 07:42.500
Humans who aren't capable of wielding
magic themselves can use 'em to fight.

07:45.080 --> 07:47.290
Neither side is making any headway at all.

07:47.290 --> 07:48.960
They look like children on a playground.

07:48.960 --> 07:53.920
If it were MY demonic army,
they would've blown that wall sky-high!

07:53.920 --> 07:55.420
True...

07:55.420 --> 07:57.630
The Republic is one thing.

07:57.630 --> 08:00.210
But I find it hard to believe
the Kingdom's magic weapons

08:00.210 --> 08:02.420
can't break through a wall like that...

08:02.710 --> 08:04.920
Our artillery is largely ineffective...

08:04.920 --> 08:07.290
I can see that, dammit!

08:09.000 --> 08:12.790
There's a possibility they've engaged an
advanced defensive spell around the wall...

08:12.790 --> 08:13.920
Impossible!

08:13.920 --> 08:16.500
They don't have a mage skilled enough!

08:17.210 --> 08:21.130
Perhaps they attached some sort of
magical device to it...

08:21.960 --> 08:25.250
They possess magical bombs loaded
with sleeping and paralysis spells.

08:25.250 --> 08:27.380
These items are also worrisome...

08:27.830 --> 08:31.130
But it would appear they're doing everything
they can to avoid using lethal force.

08:31.130 --> 08:32.920
What are you getting at?!

08:32.920 --> 08:34.540
Nothing, it's just...

08:34.540 --> 08:38.380
We're not going to make much progress
if we keep shooting at each other like this.

08:40.380 --> 08:41.880
I have an idea.

08:41.880 --> 08:43.210
What is it?

08:45.670 --> 08:47.630
Looks like they're retreating!

08:49.210 --> 08:52.080
Whew... Nice work, Denetra.

08:52.080 --> 08:53.630
That was a piece of cake.

08:53.630 --> 08:55.170
Nobody's injured?

08:55.170 --> 08:56.960
Nah, we're all good.

08:56.960 --> 08:59.080
What's the plan now, Big Sis?

08:59.080 --> 09:02.500
Let's stay here and stand guard,
at least until tomorrow.

09:02.500 --> 09:04.500
And we'll update the boss on the situa-

09:09.540 --> 09:10.960
B-Big Sis...?

09:10.960 --> 09:12.540
Snap out of it, Will!

09:12.540 --> 09:14.250
Stay low and get ready to fight!

09:15.540 --> 09:17.500
Don't panic! I'll stop the bleed-

09:18.960 --> 09:21.830
NO! NOT MY HAIR!

09:21.830 --> 09:23.500
Shut up, ya big baby!

09:27.250 --> 09:28.750
How in the hell...?

09:28.750 --> 09:30.960
They actually got through the wall...

09:32.580 --> 09:34.250
Well?! Didja kill 'em?!

09:34.250 --> 09:36.750
I grazed one of them on the arm.

09:36.750 --> 09:39.290
Hurry up and fire again!
Don't let them get away!

09:39.580 --> 09:41.630
Please let me concentrate...

09:41.630 --> 09:44.290
Penetrating the defensive barrier
around that wall

09:44.290 --> 09:47.290
requires a considerable amount of magic...

09:47.750 --> 09:50.630
If they flee, they'll be leaving
their stronghold empty.

09:50.630 --> 09:53.710
We can take our time destroying the wall
and filling in the moat.

09:56.710 --> 09:59.420
That was some brilliant magic just now.

09:59.420 --> 10:02.250
It appears they've got
a talented mage in their ranks.

10:02.250 --> 10:04.500
Things are finally getting interesting!

10:04.500 --> 10:05.500
He's here.

10:05.500 --> 10:07.290
Yup, he sure is-

10:09.080 --> 10:11.210
What are you looking at over there?

10:22.130 --> 10:23.330
Th-that's...!

10:30.880 --> 10:32.880
It's the boss!

10:33.170 --> 10:34.250
Leo!

10:35.750 --> 10:37.210
It's the man himself!

10:37.210 --> 10:39.540
Why's this dude always naked...?

10:39.830 --> 10:43.040
I came as soon as I sensed
a demonic presence in the air...

10:43.040 --> 10:45.000
Maybe I was worried for no reason...

10:46.290 --> 10:47.710
It's General Leo!

10:47.710 --> 10:50.250
What are you waiting for?!
Prepare to fire!

10:52.040 --> 10:53.250
You will NEVER...

10:57.580 --> 10:59.290
...get away with this!

11:04.000 --> 11:06.210
HHHYYYAAAAA!

11:06.210 --> 11:08.380
Wh-what...?

11:08.580 --> 11:09.960
There's no way...!

11:18.670 --> 11:20.670
Nice one! Go get 'em!

11:20.670 --> 11:22.750
Not exactly subtle, is he?

11:32.710 --> 11:34.290
That's our Leo for ya...

11:34.290 --> 11:35.380
Awesome!

11:35.380 --> 11:37.460
That wasn't magic, was it?

11:42.130 --> 11:43.710
You monster...!

11:43.710 --> 11:45.250
Captain Galmoff...

11:45.250 --> 11:49.170
It was a pleasure serving with you
during my time in the Royal Army.

11:49.170 --> 11:52.420
But if this is how the army intends to behave,

11:52.420 --> 11:54.750
then we have to put our foot down.

11:54.750 --> 11:56.830
Resistance is futile!

11:56.830 --> 12:01.210
The Kingdom will not stop.
We will continue with our operation!

12:01.210 --> 12:06.210
The peaceful negotiations you so desire
will NEVER come to pass!

12:06.460 --> 12:08.830
You were the one who taught me, Captain!

12:08.830 --> 12:11.330
That no matter how long it takes
or how difficult it may be,

12:11.330 --> 12:13.380
surrender is not an option!

12:19.500 --> 12:21.080
Do you have any idea...

12:21.460 --> 12:24.790
...how much the Chief Secretary
is suffering because of you?!

12:24.790 --> 12:27.250
You're his own personal nightmare!

12:27.250 --> 12:29.790
If I could just get rid of you...!

12:35.460 --> 12:37.290
Didn't he get shot a second ago...?

12:37.290 --> 12:39.330
Hit him dead in the throat!

12:39.580 --> 12:42.000
Deliver a message to Fred for me:

12:42.000 --> 12:44.080
"Let's have a heart-to-heart.

12:44.080 --> 12:46.880
So that you don't have to suffer any longer."

12:55.670 --> 12:57.380
Now then, Captain.

12:57.380 --> 12:59.580
I ask that you withdraw
your troops for today.

13:03.040 --> 13:04.750
GET OUTTA MY SIGHT!

13:18.580 --> 13:20.540
Hey, Boss!

13:25.670 --> 13:28.000
What happened, Big Sis?!
Did you get hurt?!

13:28.000 --> 13:29.080
Are you okay?!

13:29.080 --> 13:31.920
I'm A-OK! Just grazed me, that's all.

13:31.920 --> 13:33.420
Don't make it worse!

13:33.420 --> 13:35.130
Are you sure you're alright...?

13:35.130 --> 13:36.750
I'm fine, no biggie!

13:36.960 --> 13:38.710
Thanks, Boss.

13:38.710 --> 13:42.330
We didn't even get a chance to call you,
but you showed up just in time.

13:42.330 --> 13:43.500
Yeah...

13:43.500 --> 13:47.290
I just couldn't shake the feeling of
an ominous demonic presence...

13:47.290 --> 13:48.920
Demonic presence?

13:48.920 --> 13:52.250
Maybe it was that mage.
Y'know, Baldilocks.

13:52.250 --> 13:54.460
Nah, I don't think so...

13:54.460 --> 13:56.380
I guess it was just my imagination.

13:56.380 --> 13:59.000
Eh, oh well. It all worked out in the end.

14:01.040 --> 14:02.460
The hell happened to your hair?!

14:02.460 --> 14:03.420
Cut it out! Don't make fun of me!
The hell happened to your hair?!<b></b>

14:03.420 --> 14:04.500
Cut it out! Don't make fun of me!

14:04.500 --> 14:06.710
C'mon, stop it! It's embarrassing!
You look WAY hotter than before!<b></b>

14:06.710 --> 14:08.420
C'mon, stop it! It's embarrassing!
Lose the glasses, too!<b></b>

14:09.710 --> 14:12.880
That was incredible!
And so skillfully executed!

14:12.880 --> 14:14.710
I knew Leo could do it...

14:14.710 --> 14:17.880
THAT'S the kind of strength you need
if you want to lead a country!

14:17.880 --> 14:19.880
Maybe lower your standards a little...

14:20.130 --> 14:23.330
This just serves as another reminder
of why the Gamma Republic

14:23.330 --> 14:25.580
is able to stand its ground
against the Kingdom.

14:26.080 --> 14:28.170
Yeah, well... on the other hand,

14:28.170 --> 14:31.130
it's obvious that Leo's the only source
of strength they've got.

14:31.130 --> 14:33.250
How long can they keep it up?

14:33.630 --> 14:36.880
Whaddya think, Max?
Having seen Leo in action.

14:36.880 --> 14:39.750
If you tried to fight him right now,
would you win?

14:39.750 --> 14:41.420
Don't be ridiculous.

14:41.420 --> 14:44.080
I ain't a match for the likes of him anymore.

14:44.080 --> 14:45.580
Oh really...?

14:45.920 --> 14:47.790
Are you satisfied now, Your Grace?

14:47.790 --> 14:50.000
We oughtta head home soon.

14:50.500 --> 14:52.080
Yeah, you're right...

14:52.080 --> 14:54.670
I got to see Leo's fighting style
with my own eyes,

14:54.670 --> 14:56.960
so I suppose we can pack it in for the day.

14:56.960 --> 14:58.330
You should be grateful, Max!

14:58.330 --> 15:01.880
Thanks to my handy teleportal,
we'll be home in a jiffy!

15:03.000 --> 15:04.670
Got all your stuff?

15:04.670 --> 15:06.130
I toldja, I'm good to go.

15:06.130 --> 15:07.710
Come stand a little closer.

15:09.880 --> 15:11.130
Teleport!

15:21.330 --> 15:23.460
HURRY! TELEPORT US NOW!

15:23.460 --> 15:26.460
HE'S AFTER US!

15:28.040 --> 15:29.460
What the devil happened?!

15:29.460 --> 15:31.500
Leo spotted us!

15:32.420 --> 15:34.130
Teleport us! Do it now!

15:34.130 --> 15:35.920
H-huh?! U-uh, wait...

15:35.920 --> 15:37.960
Just gimme a minute! I can't focus!

15:39.500 --> 15:41.540
GET BACK HERE!

15:41.540 --> 15:43.380
Oh God, he's coming!

15:43.380 --> 15:45.790
That nauseating demonic presence...

15:45.790 --> 15:47.750
You're not human, are you?!

15:48.500 --> 15:51.500
You work for the Demon Lord, don't you?!

15:51.830 --> 15:53.130
I can't outrun him...!

15:56.750 --> 15:58.630
A wise decision.

16:00.080 --> 16:02.290
Pretty light on your feet, aren'tcha?

16:02.290 --> 16:03.540
Who are you?

16:03.540 --> 16:04.460
Huh?

16:04.460 --> 16:06.330
It's the nose glasses, Max.

16:07.250 --> 16:11.250
They're the reason why Leo has yet
to realize who you are!

16:11.250 --> 16:14.080
Oh yeah, I completely forgot...

16:14.080 --> 16:15.250
Wait...

16:15.460 --> 16:17.080
Was that YOUR voice?!

16:17.080 --> 16:20.040
Don't just whip out the telepathy
on me all of a sudden!

16:20.040 --> 16:23.420
I didn't have a choice!
You don't want Leo to overhear us, do you?!

16:25.000 --> 16:26.170
What's wrong?

16:26.170 --> 16:28.750
I seem to remember asking you a question.

16:28.750 --> 16:32.250
Well, if I had to guess...
you're probably spies for the Kingdom.

16:33.540 --> 16:35.630
Come up with a cover story! Hurry!

16:37.080 --> 16:39.170
Oh, don't be absurd!

16:39.170 --> 16:42.000
We are but two passers-by, I assure you...

16:42.830 --> 16:45.420
Oh my god, you call THAT a cover story?!

16:45.420 --> 16:47.920
Shuddup! The hell else do you
want me to do?!

16:47.920 --> 16:49.460
Passers-by?

16:49.460 --> 16:52.670
The road to the border is
supposed to be closed off right now...

16:52.670 --> 16:54.040
He bought it?!

16:54.290 --> 16:57.880
Well, to be honest,
it doesn't really matter who YOU are...

16:58.170 --> 17:00.040
The problem is THAT.

17:00.040 --> 17:03.250
It may look like a child,
but I know what I felt.

17:03.250 --> 17:05.670
An infinitely evil demonic power...

17:05.670 --> 17:09.960
Wh-what do you mean?
This little girl is my daughter!

17:10.330 --> 17:11.250
Mama!

17:11.250 --> 17:12.080
What, sweetheart?

17:12.080 --> 17:13.750
Bringing a demon to the border?

17:13.750 --> 17:15.710
What the hell are you plotting?

17:19.170 --> 17:23.080
If you choose to play innocent,
then I'll show you no mercy!

17:29.330 --> 17:33.040
Then I'll make you a deal:
Hand over the demon.

17:34.580 --> 17:37.830
Do that, and I'll let this
little incident slide.

17:39.250 --> 17:42.750
Max, you need to do as he says!

17:42.750 --> 17:45.920
Don't worry. I've got my teleportal.

17:45.920 --> 17:48.920
I can always wait for an opening
and then slip away.

17:49.330 --> 17:50.920
An opening?

17:50.920 --> 17:53.540
You think he's dumb enough
to let his guard down?

17:53.540 --> 17:55.130
It's fine.

17:55.130 --> 17:59.920
Worst-case scenario,
we demons can be resurrected.

17:59.920 --> 18:01.540
It's not that big a deal.

18:01.540 --> 18:03.460
Ya make a good point...

18:03.750 --> 18:06.170
Go on, hand me over to him.

18:06.170 --> 18:08.170
It's imperative that you escape.

18:10.960 --> 18:12.250
No deal.

18:13.040 --> 18:16.830
Who'd wanna listen to a
long-haired hippie like you?

18:18.170 --> 18:19.460
Oh, I LIKE you!

18:19.460 --> 18:21.250
I can buy you ten seconds.

18:21.250 --> 18:24.290
Use it to focus and finish
your teleportation spell!

18:24.290 --> 18:26.920
Ah, I knew it...
You're no ordinary man, are you?!

18:26.920 --> 18:29.630
Whatever you do,
do NOT stop casting that spell!

18:33.250 --> 18:34.710
GET A MOVE ON!

18:42.960 --> 18:44.290
No matter what happens...

18:45.880 --> 18:47.040
I WON'T stop!

18:50.170 --> 18:51.830
Sneaky brat...!

19:20.500 --> 19:21.750
YOU'RE MINE!

19:33.330 --> 19:34.540
You...

19:39.170 --> 19:40.630
You're dodging my kicks now?!

19:40.630 --> 19:42.330
Seriously, who ARE you?!

19:42.330 --> 19:44.040
You still haven't figured it out?!

19:44.040 --> 19:45.080
Are you kidding me?!

19:48.170 --> 19:49.330
It's ready, Max!

19:49.330 --> 19:50.250
Nice!

19:50.250 --> 19:51.880
What? Max...?

19:52.790 --> 19:54.670
You frickin' moron! Don't say my name!

19:54.670 --> 19:56.380
Oops... M-my bad!

19:56.380 --> 19:57.500
Max...

19:57.500 --> 19:59.750
It's you? Now it all makes sense!

19:59.750 --> 20:00.880
Let's amscray!

20:00.880 --> 20:02.130
Hold it, Max!

20:02.130 --> 20:04.130
What the hell are you thinking?!

20:04.130 --> 20:06.330
Why are you here?! No...

20:06.330 --> 20:08.880
Why are you hanging out
with a DEMON?! You're-

20:09.540 --> 20:12.790
Sorry, that's private. No comment.

20:12.790 --> 20:15.580
It's been a while.
Glad to see you're doing well.

20:25.080 --> 20:28.080
Ah... I should've known from the beginning.

20:28.960 --> 20:30.130
Yeah...

20:30.790 --> 20:32.880
So it was Max...

20:33.420 --> 20:35.040
That explains it.

20:45.540 --> 20:46.750
I need a nap...

20:46.750 --> 20:48.380
We're home...

20:48.380 --> 20:50.330
That shit hurt...!

20:50.580 --> 20:51.960
Welp...

20:51.960 --> 20:54.170
We managed to make it back in one piece.

20:54.170 --> 20:56.330
Didn't realize I missed it here so much.

20:56.330 --> 20:58.960
Ow-ow-ow!
That Leo sure was amazing, wasn't he?<b></b>

20:58.960 --> 21:00.080
Yup...

21:00.580 --> 21:03.000
But you totally stood your ground!

21:03.000 --> 21:04.960
I thought it was a spectacular fight!

21:04.960 --> 21:06.330
Oh yeah?

21:09.080 --> 21:11.250
The hot spring was great, wasn't it?

21:11.250 --> 21:13.630
Huh? Sure...

21:17.250 --> 21:20.580
What's the matter, milord?
Is something amiss?

21:21.630 --> 21:22.710
Max...

21:22.710 --> 21:24.790
Don't stare at me with yer
creepy forehead eye.

21:24.790 --> 21:26.130
Spit it out.

21:28.210 --> 21:30.630
You protected me back there...

21:31.710 --> 21:32.710
so, uh...

21:34.500 --> 21:35.630
Thanks.

21:40.420 --> 21:41.710
Forget about it.

21:42.630 --> 21:44.790
D-don't get the wrong idea!

21:44.790 --> 21:47.580
Even if I had been alone,
I could've easily escaped!

21:47.580 --> 21:49.130
Yeah, whatever.

21:49.790 --> 21:51.830
I'll kill both of you bastards...

21:51.830 --> 21:53.920
Fix the goddamn door, already!

21:57.210 --> 22:00.830
Y'know, in retrospect,
that was a pretty fun vacation!

22:00.830 --> 22:01.750
Right?!

22:01.750 --> 22:03.330
Oh, gimme a break...

22:03.330 --> 22:05.130
It ain't happenin' ever again!
